odebuddy Root:provider Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:1} {Key:codebase-design Name:codebase-design Description:Shared vocabulary for designing deep modules. Use when the user wants to design or improve a module's interface, find deepening opportunities, decide where a seam goes, make code more testable or AI-navigable, or when another skill needs the deep-module vocabulary. SourcePath:~/.codebuddy/skills/codebase-design Provider:codebuddy Root:provider Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:1} {Key:computer-use Name:computer-use Description:Drive a macOS app through the `computer` tool — read its accessibility tree, act on elements, and use real input only when the tree cannot reach the target. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/computer-use Provider:codebuddy Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:1} {Key:context-mode Name:context-mode Description:Use context-mode tools (ctx_execute, ctx_execute_file) instead of Bash/cat when processing
