        Trigger: /context-mode:ctx-doctor SourcePath:~/.codebuddy/skills/ctx-doctor Provider:codebuddy Root:provider Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:1} {Key:ctx-index Name:ctx-index Description:Index a local file or directory into context-mode's persistent FTS5 knowledge base
