        Trigger: /context-mode:ctx-index SourcePath:~/.codebuddy/skills/ctx-index Provider:codebuddy Root:provider Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:1} {Key:ctx-insight Name:ctx-insight Description:Open the context-mode Insight dashboard in your default browser.
