unexpected behavior, before proposing fixes", SourcePath:"~/.codebuddy/skills/systematic-debugging", Provider:"codebuddy", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"tavily-search", Name:"tavily-search", Description:"Search the web with LLM-optimized results via the Tavily CLI. Use this skill when the user wants to search the web, find articles, look up information, get recent news, discover sources, or says \"search for\", \"find me\", \"look up\", \"what's the latest on\", \"find articles about\", or needs current information from the internet. Returns relevant results with content snippets, relevance scores, and metadata — optimized for LLM consumption. Supports domain filtering, time ranges, and multiple search depths.", SourcePath:"~/.codebuddy/skills/tavily-search", Provider:"codebuddy", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"tdd", Name:"tdd", Description:"Test-driven development. Use when the user wants to build features or fix bugs test-first, mentions \"red-green-refactor\", or wants integration tests.", SourcePath:"~/.codebuddy/skills/tdd", Provider:"codebuddy", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"teach", Name:"teach", Description:"Teach the user a new skill or concept, within this workspace.", SourcePath:"~/.codebuddy/skills/teach", Provider:"codebuddy", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"to-questionnaire", Name:"to-questionnaire", Description:"Turn a decision you can't fully answer into a questionnaire for someone else to fill in.", SourcePath:"~/.codebuddy/skills/to-questionnaire", Provider:"codebuddy", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"to-spec", Name:"to-spec", Description:"Turn the current conversation into a spec and publish it to the project issue tracker: no interview, just synthesis of what you've already discussed.", SourcePath:"~/.codebuddy/skills/to-spec", Provider:"codebuddy", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"to-tickets", Name:"to-tickets", Description:"Break a plan, spec, or the current conversation into a set of tracer-bullet tickets, each declaring its blocking edges, published to the configured tracker (edges as text in one file per ticket locally, or native blocking links on a real tracker).", SourcePath:"~/.codebuddy/skills/to-tickets", Provider:"codebuddy", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"triage", Name:"triage", Description:"Move issues and external PRs through a state machine of triage roles, categorise, verify, grill if needed, and write agent-ready briefs.", SourcePath:"~/.codebuddy/skills/triage", Provider:"codebuddy", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"wait-what", Name:"wait-what", Description:"Stop. That last message did not land: re-pitch it.", SourcePath:"~/.codebuddy/skills/wait-what", Provider:"codebuddy", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"wayfinder", Name:"wayfinder", Description:"Plan a huge chunk of work (more than one agent session can hold) as a shared map of decision tickets on your issue tracker, and resolve them one at a time until the way to the destination is clear.", SourcePath:"~/.codebuddy/skills/wayfinder", Provider:"codebuddy", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:false, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"wizard", Name:"wizard", Description:"Generate an interactive bash wizard that walks a human through steps only they can perform. Use when provisioning infrastructure, setting up credentials or CI secrets, walking an unfamiliar third-party dashboard, or running a one-off migration or cutover. Don't invoke this for