 FileCount:2} {Key:wizard Name:wizard Description:Generate an interactive bash wizard that walks a human through steps only they can perform. Use when provisioning infrastructure, setting up credentials or CI secrets, walking an unfamiliar third-party dashboard, or running a one-off migration or cutover. Don't invoke this for steps the agent can perform itself. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/wizard Provider:qwen Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:3} {Key:writing-beats Name:writing-beats Description:Writing, exploit; assemble raw material into a journey of beats, grounding each term before a beat leans on it. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/writing-beats Provider:qwen Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2} {Key:writing-for-agents Name:writing-for-agents Description:Writing documents for agents. Use when creating or editing skills, or modifying AGENTS.md or CLAUDE.md. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/writing-for-agents Provider:qwen Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:3} {Key:writing-fragments Name:writing-fragments Description:Writing, explore: mine raw fragments, no structure yet. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/writing-fragments Provider:qwen Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2} {Key:writing-plans Name:writing-plans Description:Use when you have a spec or requirements for a multi-step task, before touching code SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/writing-plans Provider:qwen Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2} {Key:writing-shape Name:writing-shape Description:Writing, exploit: shape raw material into an article, paragraph by paragraph. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/writing-shape Provider:qwen Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2}]
